---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title='History'>
  <div class='bg-muponda-purple py-16 text-center text-white'>
    <h1 class='text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-4'>
      Nhoroondo Yedu
    </h1>
    <p class='text-white/80 text-lg'>Our Historical Journey</p>
  </div>
  <div class='max-w-(--container-width) mx-auto px-6 py-12 pb-20'>
    <div class='border-l-4 border-muponda-purple ml-4 md:ml-0 space-y-12'>
      <!-- Milestone 1 -->
      <div class='relative pl-8 md:pl-12'>
        <div
          class='absolute -left-3 top-0 w-6 h-6 bg-muponda-purple rounded-full border-4 border-background'
        >
        </div>
        <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-foreground'>
          Origins in Tanganyika
        </h3>
        <p class='text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-2'>
          Our oral tradition confirms that the "Dzinde" (the root/origin) is in <strong
            >Tanganyika</strong
          > (modern-day Tanzania/Ruvuma region).
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Milestone 2 -->
      <div class='relative pl-8 md:pl-12'>
        <div
          class='absolute -left-3 top-0 w-6 h-6 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-background'
        >
        </div>
        <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-foreground'>The Great Migration</h3>
        <p class='text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-2'>
          The ancestors traveled south, crossing the Kasambavezi (Zambezi),
          Gorongoza, and Rwenya rivers.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Milestone 3 -->
      <div class='relative pl-8 md:pl-12'>
        <div
          class='absolute -left-3 top-0 w-6 h-6 bg-secondary rounded-full border-4 border-background'
        >
        </div>
        <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-foreground'>
          Settlement in Manyika
        </h3>
        <p class='text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-2'>
          The dynasty established itself in Manyika, with sacred sites at Ruunji
          and Nyazongo.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
